WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.700
An exam paper.

2
00:00:01.750 --> 00:00:05.630
One printed scene from
Macbeth, just after the murder.

3
00:00:05.680 --> 00:00:11.610
Macbeth stares at his hands: "Will all
great Neptune's ocean wash this blood Clean

4
00:00:11.660 --> 00:00:13.020
from my hand?"

5
00:00:13.070 --> 00:00:15.590
But the question asks about this extract,

6
00:00:15.640 --> 00:00:17.380
and the play as a whole.

7
00:00:17.430 --> 00:00:18.550
Five acts.

8
00:00:18.600 --> 00:00:20.420
Five closed books.

9
00:00:20.470 --> 00:00:22.850
So where do you start: the printed scene,

10
00:00:22.900 --> 00:00:24.370
or Act 1?

11
00:00:24.420 --> 00:00:27.370
In this mission, you'll
take an exam question apart,

12
00:00:27.420 --> 00:00:29.830
and see what it's really asking you to do.

13
00:00:29.880 --> 00:00:31.900
Retell the play from Act 1?

14
00:00:31.950 --> 00:00:34.240
Write out every quotation you know?

15
00:00:34.290 --> 00:00:35.590
You'll test both.

16
00:00:35.640 --> 00:00:38.050
And you'll lay the play out on a timeline,

17
00:00:38.100 --> 00:00:42.060
act by act, and pick the
strongest link to the whole play.

18
00:00:42.110 --> 00:00:44.750
Your mission: work out where to start.
